From 102061efb035067393a174198a6ed41d354e5e4d Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Cursor Agent <cursoragent@cursor.com>
Date: Mon, 24 Aug 2026 23:03:20 +0000
Subject: [PATCH 6/6] deps: update x/image and the Go toolchain for known
 advisories

golang.org/x/image carried fixes the client had not picked up, and the
encoding/xml recursion guard from Go 1.26.6 matters because clientinfo.xml and
the pet talk table come from the data directory. govulncheck now reports no
findings.
---
 go.mod | 8 +++++---
 go.sum | 6 ++++++
 2 files changed, 11 insertions(+), 3 deletions(-)

